WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.487
Hi, I'm Basil. I said Tania couldn't easily turn

00:00:03.487 --> 00:00:06.975
Career Empire into something Curios teachers could make their

00:00:06.975 --> 00:00:08.912
own. Well, here we are!

00:00:09.412 --> 00:00:13.461
Her prompts were simple: keep the world, avatars, buildings

00:00:13.461 --> 00:00:17.510
and characters; remove the careers content; and leave the

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.559
original untouched. The first explorable copy took about fifteen

00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:25.609
minutes. The teacher tools, branding, app rooms and testing

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:26.508
came afterwards.

00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:30.254
Now the campus is a shared front door for

00:00:30.254 --> 00:00:33.499
teacher-created apps. Follow a sign and walk inside to

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:36.745
open Archon Engine, Art Quest or Loopy Tunes. Return

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:39.990
to Curios brings you back. Avatar Studio is still

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:40.351
here.

00:00:40.851 --> 00:00:44.474
Teachers can change names, conversations and room links in

00:00:44.474 --> 00:00:48.096
Teacher setup. Preview your ideas, then give ICT the

00:00:48.096 --> 00:00:51.719
settings to publish. Your curriculum gives this world its

00:00:51.719 --> 00:00:52.121
purpose.

00:00:52.621 --> 00:00:57.174
Reuse. Repurpose. Recycle. Curios: learning without limits. Apparently, you

00:00:57.174 --> 00:01:01.726
can teach an old N P C new tricks.

